OL,5,G2000 The Pride of Britain Awards 2026
OL,6,     FThis year's ceremony from London's
OL,7,     FGrosvenor House Hotel sees a
OL,8,     Fstar-studded line up including His
OL,9,     FMajesty The King, Jude
OL,10,     FBelllingham, Davina McCall and
OL,11,     FAlan Carr celebrate the nation's
OL,12,     Funsung heroes. Hosted by Carol
OL,13,     FVorderman and Ashley Banjo, expect
OL,14,     Fplenty of emotion and surprises
OL,15,     Falong with inspirational stories
OL,16,     Fof bravery, achievement and
OL,17,     Fselflessness. Plus, stepping off
OL,18,     Ftheir 25th Anniversary Tour for a
OL,19,     Fspecial performance are boyband
