OL,5,G0300 British Touring Car Championship
OL,6,G     Highlights
OL,7,     FNicki Shields presents action from
OL,8,     Fthe 10th and final weekend of the
OL,9,     Fseason from Brands Hatch,
OL,10,     Ffeaturing the 28th, 29th and 30th
OL,11,     Fraces of the campaign. In the
OL,12,     Fprevious meeting at Silverstone,
OL,13,     FAshley Sutton secured the
OL,14,     Fchampionship in style, clinching
OL,15,     Fan unprecedented fifth BTCC title
OL,16,     Fwith four races to spare, but
OL,17,     Fother titles were still to be
OL,18,     Fdecided. With commentary by David
OL,19,     FAddison and Tim Harvey
